FlashGBLink
===========

This project includes or derives from the following work:

FlashGBX
  Author: Lesserkuma
  https://github.com/Lesserkuma/FlashGBX
  License: GPL-3.0-or-later
  The four small profile fixtures under tests/fixtures/ are copied from
  FlashGBX's config/ directory for the hardware-free tests; the plugin and CLI
  use FlashGBX's installed profile database at runtime. The profile loader and command template handling in flashgbx.py
  and flash.py follow FlashGBX's Flashcart and CLI behaviour. Cartridge
  detection and CFI decoding call FlashGBX's Flashcart and CFI classes at
  runtime. The M36L0R8060B / Intel command sequences used by the original
  flasher came from the same profile data.

gbasend-rs
  Author: nullstalgia
  https://github.com/nullstalgia/gbasend-rs
  License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
  The prebuilt gbasend-pico firmware images in firmware/ are unmodified
  copies from that repository.

Nintendo logo
  The Game Boy Advance cartridge header embedded in the payload includes the
  Nintendo logo. It is a trademark of Nintendo and is present only because the
  console's BIOS requires it to boot the payload.
